AI-Aware Threat Library (aialib)
Copyright 2026 Ali Aljaberi

This product includes software developed at the Mohamed bin Zayed University of
Artificial Intelligence (MBZUAI). Static analysis is performed via the Bandit
project (https://github.com/PyCQA/bandit, Apache 2.0) and the Semgrep project
(https://semgrep.dev, LGPL-2.1). MITRE ATLAS technique references are used
under the terms published by The MITRE Corporation
(https://atlas.mitre.org/). CWE identifiers are maintained by The MITRE
Corporation (https://cwe.mitre.org/).

This artifact accompanies the master's thesis "Why AI-Generated Code Is
Vulnerable: Cause Taxonomy, Threat Mapping, and CI/CD Security Controls"
(MBZUAI, 2026).
